  m_text: "<b>Retrain your Brain with 5 Short Memory Exercises!</b>\r\nNumber 1:
    Reverse Sentences\r\nFor example: If your friend says, \u2018The sky is clear
    tonight,\u2019 you would say, \u2018Tonight clear is sky the.\u2019\r\nAim to
    do this at least [VAR] times per day for maximum results, including faster recall
    and reduction of the appearance of dementia symptoms.\r\n"
